swift test --filter "MLXBackgroundInstallTests|ModelDownloaderTests|KokoroInstallTests"   (2026-09-22, after the cancel row's wait was fixed)

􀢄  Test "deleteModel during a transfer stops it, and the caller hears CancellationError" recorded an issue at MLXBackgroundInstallTests.swift:181:9: Expectation failed: !FileManager.default.fileExists(atPath: bench.scratch.path)
􀢄  Test run with 21 tests in 3 suites failed after 0.395 seconds with 1 issue.

WHY: discard() cancelled the plan's tasks and the fetcher removed the scratch — but a task whose
bytes had all arrived (a 32-byte config.json) was past cancelling: its didFinishDownloadingTo was
already on its way to the relay on the session's own queue, and the relay moved the file into the
scratch, recreating the directory with one small file inside. Fixed by marking the destinations
discarded in the relay BEFORE cancelling; a landing for a discarded destination is left to die
with its temporary file, and a later transfer of the same files reinstates them. Green after.
